{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026XMf3K6XAkA1794907831.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>內地自主研製的大型運輸投送無人機「長鷹-8」，近日完成運輸投送試驗。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.PLANE-1530_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Br2wEQSkNf1794907851.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>央視公布試驗片段，工作人員在「長鷹-8」起飛前先檢查貨艙，之後無人機按預定航線起飛。來到投放區域300米半空，裝載物資的貨盤按指令自動出艙，降落傘打開，最後降落在預定地點50米範圍內，較原本計劃的100米範圍更精準。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.PLANE-1530_004.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026JraAPGJSFm1794907863.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>「長鷹-8」最多能裝載3.5噸貨物，並能在15分鐘內完成裝卸，最大航程超過3,000公里。具備高原升降及最短200米的短距離升降能力，可適應不同環境的升降條件。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T10:12:06.479146+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":224,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T08:37:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T19:32:52.715169+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T10:05:27.756777+00:00","content_hash":"fa14fee057aa27f81f67a5b31df07bdf497e94468f02072a44d0373352331902","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-17T10:12:06.479146+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}